# Multi-Agent Wedding Planner with LangChain

> A Streamlit and CLI wedding-planning assistant that turns a couple's preferences into a research-backed wedding plan using LangChain, Groq, and Tavily web search with a **parallel pipeline architecture**.

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.12+-3776AB?logo=python&logoColor=white)](https://www.python.org/)
[![LangChain](https://img.shields.io/badge/LangChain-Agents-1C3C3C)](https://www.langchain.com/)
[![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-UI-FF4B4B?logo=streamlit&logoColor=white)](https://streamlit.io/)
[![Groq](https://img.shields.io/badge/Groq-qwen%2Fqwen3.6--27b-f55036?logo=groq&logoColor=white)](https://groq.com/)
[![Tavily](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tavily-Web%20Search-0EA5E9)](https://www.tavily.com/)
[![uv](https://img.shields.io/badge/uv-Package%20Manager-DE5FE9)](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)

---

## What Is This?

This project is a portfolio-ready **multi-agent wedding planning system**. The user provides a structured wedding brief: location, date, guest count, budget, style direction, priorities, constraints, and cultural details. A **parallel pipeline** coordinates 8 specialized domain researchers that run simultaneously — each performing a targeted Tavily web search followed by a single LLM synthesis call — and then a final LLM synthesizes all 8 domain reports into a client-ready wedding plan.

**Key innovation**: Replaced sequential agent loops (5-10 min) with a parallel pipeline (~1-2 min) using ThreadPoolExecutor, TTL caching, and retry/circuit-breaker resilience.

The project includes two ways to run the planner:

- **Streamlit app**: polished browser workflow with API-key status, sample brief loading, structured inputs, **real-time streaming progress**, generated output tabs, saved runs, and a Markdown download button.
- **CLI app**: terminal entry point that accepts free-form wedding requirements and prints the generated plan with per-domain timing.

| File | Responsibility |
|------|----------------|
| `app.py` | Streamlit interface, form workflow, API-key handling, **streaming progress**, saved runs, result rendering |
| `main.py` | CLI workflow for entering wedding requirements and invoking the parallel pipeline |
| `pipeline.py` | **Core parallel pipeline engine** — 8 domains in parallel, synthesis, caching, retry |
| `cache.py` | **TTLCache wrapper** for Tavily results (1hr TTL, 128 entries max) |
| `retry.py` | **Retry decorator** (exponential backoff) + **circuit breaker** pattern |
| `models.py` | Groq model init + **Pydantic models** for DomainReport & PipelineResult |
| `prompts.py` | 8 per-domain synthesis prompts + final synthesis prompt |
| `agents/registry.py` | Domain task registry (prompts + query builders) |
| `tools/*.py` | 24 Tavily search tools (3 per domain) |
| `pyproject.toml` | Python version and dependency definitions for `uv` |

